        "abstract": "The operation of various tapered stripe devices have been investigated theoretically by using generalized travelling wave equations, where the effects of diffraction and carrier-induced refractive index variation are taken into account. The partial differential equations are solved by using a modified beam-propagation-method, which is computationally intensive, requiring a large number of longitudinal segments and lateral mesh points. The simulation also involves calculating the carrier density by integrating the carrier diffusion equation at time increments of less than 0.5ps, and obtains the full dynamics of filament formation.",
